McDonald,
R.
> > A.
>>> > >> Point Transect Sampling Along Linear Features Biometrics, 2010, 66,
>>> > >> 1247-
>>> > >> 1255
>>> > >>
>>> > >> This paper also describes a way to deal with this issue at the
>>> > >> analysis stage under a particular setting, but I would really
>>> > >> recommend you avoid the problem by design whenever possible. This
> > is
>>> > >> because the information in the data is not enough to adequately
>>> > >> separate the process of availability and detectability, and hence,
>>> > >> unless you have independent information about one of these
> > processes,
>>> > >> they are confounded and you can't confidently estimate either of
>>> > >> them, which precludes you to get robust density estimates.
